{
  "uid": "goodput-inference",
  "title": "goodput-stack / inference",
  "tags": [
    "goodput-stack"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "description": "Gateway, EPP and engine metrics per InferencePool. sim-pool is SIMULATED.",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Latency (per pool, where the data exists)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Engine TTFT p50 / p95",
      "description": "Server-side TTFT from vllm:time_to_first_token_seconds (sim-pool only). SIMULATED: llm-d-inference-sim v0.10.2, latencies are configured, not measured on a model. llama.cpp b11146 exports no latency histograms (only counters/gauges), so there is no llamacpp-pool series here. Engine TTFT excludes the gateway hop, EPP pick and network; client TTFT (scripts/, autoscaling/loadgen.py) includes them. Measured 2026-10-14 (observability/evidence/panels-20261014-222133.json): the sim's TTFT also EXCLUDES queue wait: engine TTFT p95 max 0.0855 s while client TTFT p50 was 1.54 s with up to 4 requests waiting. See 'Engine queue time'.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le, pool) (rate(vllm:time_to_first_token_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"inference\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{pool}} (engine)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, pool) (rate(vllm:time_to_first_token_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"inference\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{pool}} (engine)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Engine ITL p50 / p95",
      "description": "vllm:inter_token_latency_seconds (sim-pool only). SIMULATED: llm-d-inference-sim v0.10.2, latencies are configured, not measured on a model. llama.cpp b11146 exports no latency histograms (only counters/gauges), so there is no llamacpp-pool series here.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le, pool) (rate(vllm:inter_token_latency_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"inference\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{pool}} (engine)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, pool) (rate(vllm:inter_token_latency_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"inference\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{pool}} (engine)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Engine queue time p50 / p95",
      "description": "vllm:request_queue_time_seconds: time waiting for a batch slot, which the sim's TTFT histogram leaves out. Client TTFT ~= queue time + engine TTFT + gateway/EPP/network. SIMULATED: llm-d-inference-sim v0.10.2, latencies are configured, not measured on a model. llama.cpp b11146 exports no latency histograms (only counters/gauges), so there is no llamacpp-pool series here. (llama.cpp's wait shows only as llamacpp:requests_deferred.)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le, pool) (rate(vllm:request_queue_time_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"inference\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{pool}} (engine)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, pool) (rate(vllm:request_queue_time_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"inference\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{pool}} (engine)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Gateway request duration p50 / p95 (end of stream, NOT TTFT)",
      "description": "agentgateway_request_duration_seconds, both pools. Measured on 2026-10-14: a 120-token stream's duration grew this histogram's sum by 1.9356 s vs client total 1.936 s and client TTFB 0.033 s, so it ends at the END of the stream. agentgateway v1.6.0 exports no TTFT/first-byte histogram for these routes (upstream_call_duration_seconds has no series). This is the only latency series for llamacpp-pool.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le, pool) (rate(agentgateway_request_duration_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"inference\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{pool}} (gateway)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, pool) (rate(agentgateway_request_duration_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"inference\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{pool}} (gateway)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Engine TTFT vs gateway e2e (sim-pool, p95)",
      "description": "Side by side: what the engine measures vs what the gateway measures for the same requests. Gateway e2e \u2212 engine e2e \u2248 gateway + EPP + network overhead. No gateway TTFT exists to compare with engine TTFT. SIMULATED: llm-d-inference-sim v0.10.2, latencies are configured, not measured on a model.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, pool) (rate(vllm:time_to_first_token_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"inference\",pool=\"sim-pool\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "engine TTFT p95",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, pool) (rate(vllm:e2e_request_latency_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"inference\",pool=\"sim-pool\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "engine e2e p95",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, pool) (rate(agentgateway_request_duration_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"inference\",pool=\"sim-pool\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "gateway e2e p95",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
