      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Output tokens/s",
      "description": "Engine counters. sim-pool is SIMULATED: llm-d-inference-sim v0.10.2, latencies are configured, not measured on a model.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
