    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "KV-cache usage (sim-pool only)",
      "description": "vllm:kv_cache_usage_perc (0-1). SIMULATED: llm-d-inference-sim v0.10.2, latencies are configured, not measured on a model. It read 0 throughout the 2026-10-14 load runs (max 4 waiting), so the sim does not model KV pressure in this config. llama.cpp b11146 exports no KV-cache metric (GAPS.md P4), so llamacpp-pool has no series here on purpose.",
      "datasource": {
